{"id":"954fd7bdc8079d2a","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness.md","title":"Type 4 Second Incompleteness with One Negative Fixed Point","display":"thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness — Type 4 Second Incompleteness with One Negative Fixed Point","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness — Type 4 Second Incompleteness with One Negative Fixed Point","source":"第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 4（PDF 144）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness — Type 4 Second Incompleteness with One Negative Fixed Point"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 4（PDF 144）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type4}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Type4}(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in S\">\\(\\gamma\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_MB\\gamma)\\in P\">\\((\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_MB\\gamma)\\in P\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{consis}_M=\\neg_M Bf\">\\(\\mathrm{consis}_M=\\neg_M Bf\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}type4\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{consis}_M\\notin P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}type4\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{consis}_M\\notin P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从固定点的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\Rightarrow\\neg_MB\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\Rightarrow\\neg_MB\\gamma\\)</span>，用 P1/P2 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\gamma\\Rightarrow B(\\neg_MB\\gamma)\">\\(B\\gamma\\Rightarrow B(\\neg_MB\\gamma)\\)</span> 可证；P3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\gamma\\Rightarrow B(B\\gamma)\">\\(B\\gamma\\Rightarrow B(B\\gamma)\\)</span> 可证。将永真式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_MB\\gamma\\Rightarrow(B\\gamma\\Rightarrow f)\">\\(\\neg_MB\\gamma\\Rightarrow(B\\gamma\\Rightarrow f)\\)</span> 先内化，再两次使用 P2，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\neg_MB\\gamma)\\Rightarrow(B(B\\gamma)\\Rightarrow Bf)\">\\(B(\\neg_MB\\gamma)\\Rightarrow(B(B\\gamma)\\Rightarrow Bf)\\)</span> 可证。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\gamma\\Rightarrow Bf\">\\(B\\gamma\\Rightarrow Bf\\)</span> 可证。</p>\n<p>反置与固定点的反向蕴涵于是给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{consis}_M\\Rightarrow\\gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{consis}_M\\Rightarrow\\gamma\\)</span> 可证。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{consis}_M\\in P\">\\(\\mathrm{consis}_M\\in P\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in P\">\\(\\gamma\\in P\\)</span>，Normal 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\gamma\\in P\">\\(B\\gamma\\in P\\)</span>，又得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Bf\\in P\">\\(Bf\\in P\\)</span>；它与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_MBf\\in P\">\\(\\neg_MBf\\in P\\)</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in P\">\\(f\\in P\\)</span>，违背相容性。</p>\n<p>原书此结果仅要求一个负固定点。全局 ReflexiveSys、完整对角化性质、稳定性和可证性正确性均非前提；它比通过全局 Löb 定理获得的第二不完备性使用更少固定点假设。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 4（PDF 144）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-type-g-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"3c0bfff14ec726c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type4}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"(\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_MB\\gamma)\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{consis}_M=\\neg_M Bf","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}type4\\text{-}second\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{consis}_M\\notin P.","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma\\Rightarrow\\neg_MB\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"B\\gamma\\Rightarrow B(\\neg_MB\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\gamma\\Rightarrow B(B\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_MB\\gamma\\Rightarrow(B\\gamma\\Rightarrow f)","display":false},{"tex":"B(\\neg_MB\\gamma)\\Rightarrow(B(B\\gamma)\\Rightarrow Bf)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\gamma\\Rightarrow Bf","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{consis}_M\\Rightarrow\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{consis}_M\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"B\\gamma\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"Bf\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_MBf\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in P","display":false}],"bytes":1902,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]] → [[92-thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness]]与[[92-thm-type-g-characterization]]。Normal、Stable、Type 4、Type G 的条件分别列出；单固定点版第二不完备性使用的固定点假设更少。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["3c0bfff14ec726c0"]}